g", "id": "611529381330656", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035319_611529384663989_2761552413337527397_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CKLTrrHPhg0Q7kNvwH6gzGi&_nc_oc=AdqeUTp2AFcJykE5WumbSb3SgwByk21x3sw9awBkFzHwnRF9h8whKHt-JJrYt_3JK2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ8QWxGV5GP1y3OXzweQFFQXZ6_BK86No4LmVK_bBNbTw&oe=6B0710F2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Photoroom-20250103_203510.png", "id": "1657393174816640", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031604_1657393178149973_8342254906667433932_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YBgg473VSooQ7kNvwFt3UuM&_nc_oc=Adp1-c_k2_QztYoCX5VWyW0p8Q8Yafy-x89iyL-EDmq3QZxkPGJ16mCL4MQywlLNlbI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRMS32_R8HBkxZ5vh3o2Uxi2bjwtR_TrkyzNGv4-bmfhQ&oe=6B071452"}, "display_name": "Spatial Phone : Mirror & Control", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# **UPDATE: You can control your iPhone \ud83d\udcf1 in VR using the Spatial Phone app!**\n\nFinally figured out a way to control your iPhone in VR on your Meta Quest \u2014  something that was previously only possible on Android.\n {713821661542598}\n\nYou can mirror and control your iPhone/Android phone directly onto your Meta Quest with high-quality passthrough and low latency. Use it in any app or game.\n\nNote : iPhone needs to be paired with your Meta Quest each time you want to use the control feature. This is a limitation of the current technology and may be resolved in the future.\n\n# Features:\n\n**\ud83d\udd39 High-Resolution Passthrough**\n{1416266739395027}\nEnjoy crystal-clear visuals of your Android/iOS device inside your Meta Quest headset with very low latency and stereo audio (40ms-90ms)\n\n**\ud83d\udd39 Can be used with other apps/games**\n{1485561639489864}\n This app can be used in background with other app/games\n\n**\ud83d\udd39 Control with Meta Quest Controllers**\n{1469651341149898}\n\n**\ud83d\udd39 Easy to connect and private peer-to-peer connection**\n{705784252315372}\nConnect on the same network or internet without any custom setting. Your data stays private with end-to-end peer-to-peer connections. No additional data is collected or stored.\n\n\n\nFor additional help you can reach out on discord :  https://discord.gg/99qgmSxUZ9\n\n\n{1367013974588349}\nRequirements : iPhone or Android 8+ are currently supported.\n\nThe companion software is free to download.", "short_description": "You can mirror and control your iPhone or Android phone directly in your Meta Quest. Which offers high quality passthrough, stereo sound quality.\nIt's easy to connect too.\n\nRequirements : iPhone or Android 8+ is supported\n\nYou can use this to read pdf, watch videos, reply to text, music and control your device without leaving the Meta Quest headset.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/4f218ce8-3057-4610-8545-49362731f8ab", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "butter chicken pizza", "support_website_url": "https://tinyurl.com/zp2s2m4f", "website_url": "https://spatial-phone-mirror-control-9ab924.webflow.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1055187466124150"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "